{%- comment -%}
  EyeWipes offer page (deploy retry marker)
  ===================
  Faithful Shopify implementation of the approved Claude Design page
  "EyeWipes Offer Page v1" (evergreen) and, during the World Animal Week
  campaign window (28 Sep – 4 Oct 2026 inclusive, store timezone), the
  approved "EyeWipes World Animal Week 2026" design. {{ waw_active }} below
  is the single switch between the two — no separate template, no new URL.
  Outside the window this renders byte-for-byte the same evergreen page it
  always has.

  The WAW design narrows the plan picker to the two Kaching deals it shows
  (Start The Routine Kit / Complete Eye Care Routine); the third ("Multi-Pet
  Relief Plan") deal stays fully configured in Kaching but its bar is hidden
  with CSS for the duration of the campaign — see the ".kaching-bundles"
  rules tagged WAW in assets/eyewipes-offer-page.css. Nothing about Kaching's
  own config changes.

  Rendered only through templates/product.eyewipes-offer-page.json, assigned to
  the existing live EyeWipes product. The canonical product URL is unchanged.

  COMMERCE OWNERSHIP
  ------------------
  Kaching Bundles is the source of truth for tier, quantity, deal, selling plan,
  bundle properties and free gifts. Its app block is rendered below inside the
  purchase module and its real controls stay authoritative — assets/eyewipes-offer-page.css
  restyles those exact nodes to the approved design rather than cloning them.

  The "Complete Eye Care Routine" deal's free-gift list ships as combined
  Kaching line-items rather than three separate rows for the three physical
  gifts (Tear Stain Comb / Bright Eyes in 30 Days e-book / Bright Eyes
  Routine Tracker) — mirrors the FreshWipes finding of the same shape. The
  on-page gift toggle therefore shows a hand-authored three-row panel (exact
  approved names, images and descriptions) rather than Kaching's own row,
  which stays in the DOM (for correct add-to-cart behaviour) but hidden from
  view. Kaching's own "most popular" badge text is a Kaching-dashboard-owned
  string this theme cannot rewrite from here — verify it live and, if it
  reads anything other than "Limited Time: Buy 2, Get 2 Free", that is an
  optional Kaching-admin fix, not a theme bug.

  There is exactly ONE add-to-cart pathway: the theme's <product-form> rendered
  in `.ewof-form-host`. The sticky bar and the final offer CTA are proxies that
  submit that same form; they carry no quantity, gift or selling-plan logic.

  Everything is scoped under #eyewipes-offer-page.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign product_form_id = 'ewof-product-form-' | append: section.id

  # World Animal Week campaign window — 28 Sep through 4 Oct 2026 inclusive,
  # evaluated in the shop's own timezone (Liquid's `now` is already shop-local).
  assign today_str = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
  assign waw_active = false
  if today_str >= '2026-09-28' and today_str <= '2026-10-04'
    assign waw_active = true
  endif

  if waw_active
    assign hero_heading = 'Clear The Buildup Around Their Eyes In 30 Seconds A Day'
    assign hero_sub = 'Textured, pre-moistened wipes for daily eye-area care — for dogs and cats with gunk, discharge and crusty eyes'
    assign bullet2 = 'Aloe and chamomile, chosen to be gentle on the skin around the eyes'
    assign cta_scroll_text = 'Get The World Animal Week Offer ↑'
    assign tier1_name = 'Complete Eye Care Routine'
    assign tier1_cta = 'Add To Cart — Buy 2, Get 2 Free'
    assign tier1_badge = 'Buy 2, Get 2 Free'
    assign tier1_image = 'ewof-tier-4jars-waw.webp' | asset_url
    assign tier1_image_alt = 'World Animal Week — Buy 2, Get 2 Free. Four jars of VetPets EyeWipes with the Tear Stain Comb, the Bright Eyes Routine Tracker and the Bright Eyes in 30 Days e-book'
    assign offer_badge_text = 'World Animal Week — Buy 2, Get 2 Free + Free Gifts'
    assign guar_t = 'Try the routine for 100 days — or <span class="accent">every penny back</span>'
    assign guar_c = "Use EyeWipes daily for up to 100 days. If they are not right for your pet, contact VetPets for a full refund. No questions, no forms, no hassle."
    assign offer_bullet3 = 'Backed by the 100-day money-back guarantee'
  else
    assign hero_heading = section.settings.heading
    assign hero_sub = section.settings.subheading
    assign bullet2 = 'Aloe + chamomile stop it growing back overnight'
    assign cta_scroll_text = 'Get Buy 2, Get 2 Free ↑'
    assign tier1_name = 'Build The Habit Kit'
    assign tier1_cta = 'Add To Cart — Buy 2, Get 2 Free'
    assign tier1_badge = 'Buy 2, Get 2 Free'
    assign tier1_image = 'ewof-eyewipes-offer-approved.webp' | asset_url
    assign tier1_image_alt = 'Four jars of VetPets EyeWipes with the Tear Stain Comb, the Bright Eyes Routine Tracker and the Bright Eyes in 30 Days e-book'
    assign offer_badge_text = 'Buy 2, Get 2 Free + Free Gifts'
    assign guar_t = 'Healthy, clear eyes — or <span class="accent">every penny back</span>'
    assign guar_c = "Use EyeWipes daily for up to 100 days. If you don't see the difference, you get a full refund. No questions, no forms, no hassle."
    assign offer_bullet3 = 'Visible difference in 3 weeks — or every penny back'
  endif
-%}

{{ 'eyewipes-offer-page.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<link rel="preload" as="image" href="{{ 'ewof-tier-2jars.webp' | asset_url }}">
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="{{ tier1_image }}">

<div id="eyewipes-offer-page" data-rc="on" data-tier="build" data-waw="{% if waw_active %}on{% else %}off{% endif %}">

  {%- if waw_active -%}
    {%- comment -%} ---------- World Animal Week countdown top bar ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="wtop" data-screen-label="World Animal Week countdown">
      <div class="wtop-in">
        <div class="wtop-l"><svg class="wtop-ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.4" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="1.7"></circle><path d="M2.6 12h18.8M12 2.6c2.6 2.6 4 5.9 4 9.4s-1.4 6.8-4 9.4c-2.6-2.6-4-5.9-4-9.4s1.4-6.8 4-9.4Z" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg><span class="wtop-lt"><span class="wtop-t">World Animal Week Sale</span><span class="wtop-date">28 September – 4 October 2026</span></span></div>
        <div class="wtop-mid"><span class="wtop-offer">Buy 2, Get 2 Free + 3 Free Gifts</span><span class="wtop-dead">Ends Oct 4</span></div>
        <div class="wtop-r"><span class="wtop-lab">Ends in</span>
          <div class="wtop-cd" role="timer" aria-label="World Animal Week sale ends in">
            <div class="wtop-c1"><span class="wtop-n" data-cd="d">00</span><span class="wtop-u">Days</span></div>
            <div class="wtop-c1"><span class="wtop-n" data-cd="h">00</span><span class="wtop-u">Hrs</span></div>
            <div class="wtop-c1"><span class="wtop-n" data-cd="m">00</span><span class="wtop-u">Min</span></div>
            <div class="wtop-c1"><span class="wtop-n" data-cd="s">00</span><span class="wtop-u">Sec</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    {%- comment -%} ---------- evergreen rotating announcement bar (no countdown, no scarcity copy) ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="topbar">
      <div class="topbar-in">
        <div class="announce" role="status" aria-label="Offer highlights">
          <span class="announce-msg" data-announce-msg>
            <svg class="announce-icon" data-announce-icon viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M11.5 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6.5a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.5 8.5a2 2 0 0 0 2.828 0l6.5-6.5a2 2 0 0 0 0-2.828l-8.5-8.5A2 2 0 0 0 11.5 3Z"></path>
              <circle cx="7.25" cy="7.25" r="1.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
            </svg>
            <span class="announce-text" data-announce-text>{{ section.settings.announce_msg1 }}</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} ---------- SECTION 1 — above the fold ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="hero" id="ewof-hero">
    <div class="hero-in">

      {%- comment -%} gallery: tier-driven slide 1 + approved PDP squares {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gal">
        <div class="g-badges" aria-live="polite">
          <span class="g-pill">Buy 2, Get 2 Free</span>
          <span class="g-pill2" hidden></span>
        </div>
        <div class="railwrap">
          <div class="rail" id="ewof-rail" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="EyeWipes gallery — use left and right arrow keys">
            <div class="slide s-offer">
              <img
                class="im im-fit"
                id="ewof-tier-img"
                src="{{ tier1_image }}"
                width="900"
                height="900"
                fetchpriority="high"
                decoding="async"
                alt="{{ tier1_image_alt }}">
            </div>
            {%- assign pdp_slides = 'ewof-pdp-2-daily-care.webp|EyeWipes daily eye-cleaning benefits for dogs;ewof-pdp-3-buildup-returns.webp|Why daily eye buildup and tear stains return;ewof-pdp-4-textured-pad.webp|Close-up of the textured EyeWipes pad;ewof-pdp-5-before-after.webp|EyeWipes daily routine before-and-after presentation;ewof-pdp-6-three-steps.webp|How to use EyeWipes in three steps;ewof-pdp-7-comparison.webp|EyeWipes product-feature comparison;ewof-pdp-8-ingredients.webp|EyeWipes gentle ingredient overview;ewof-pdp-9-guarantee.webp|100-Day Money-Back Guarantee — try EyeWipes risk-free' | split: ';' -%}
            {%- for s in pdp_slides -%}
              {%- assign parts = s | split: '|' -%}
              <div class="slide s-pdp">
                <img class="im im-fit" src="{{ parts[0] | asset_url }}" width="823" height="823" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="{{ parts[1] }}">
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="navbtn navbtn-p" aria-label="Previous image">&lsaquo;</button>
          <button type="button" class="navbtn navbtn-n" aria-label="Next image">&rsaquo;</button>
        </div>

        <div class="dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Gallery slides">
          {%- for i in (1..9) -%}
            <button type="button" class="dot{% if forloop.first %} on{% endif %}" aria-label="Slide {{ i }}"></button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        <div class="thumbs" role="tablist" aria-label="Gallery thumbnails">
          <button type="button" class="thumb on" aria-label="Selected kit bundle" aria-selected="true">
            <img src="{{ tier1_image }}" data-ewof-tier-thumb width="900" height="900" alt="">
          </button>
          {%- for s in pdp_slides -%}
            {%- assign parts = s | split: '|' -%}
            <button type="button" class="thumb" aria-label="{{ parts[1] }}" aria-selected="false">
              <img src="{{ parts[0] | asset_url }}" width="823" height="823" loading="lazy" alt="">
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} purchase module {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="buy">
        {%- if waw_active -%}
          <div class="waw-hero-lab">
            <span class="waw-hero-lab-i" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" style="fill:none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.4" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="1.8"></circle><path d="M2.6 12h18.8M12 2.6c2.6 2.6 4 5.9 4 9.4s-1.4 6.8-4 9.4c-2.6-2.6-4-5.9-4-9.4s1.4-6.8 4-9.4Z" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="1.6"></path></svg></span>
            <span class="waw-hero-lab-t">
              <span class="waw-hero-lab-1">World Animal Week</span>
              <span class="waw-hero-lab-2">Limited-Time Sale</span>
            </span>
            <span class="waw-hero-lab-dead">Ends Oct 4</span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <h1 class="h1">{{ hero_heading }}
          <span class="h1-sub">{{ hero_sub }}</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="rating" style="margin-top:11px">
          <span class="stars" role="img" aria-label="Rated 4.8 out of 5">★★★★★</span>
          <span>4.8/5 · Trusted by 45,000+ Dog Owners</span>
        </div>

        <div class="bullets">
          <div class="bullet">
            {% render 'ewof-check', size: 19 %}
            <span>Textured surface lifts the buildup off the skin</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bullet">
            {% render 'ewof-check', size: 19 %}
            <span>{{ bullet2 }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bullet">
            {% render 'ewof-check', size: 19 %}
            <span>30 seconds a day — no rinsing, no mixing, no fight</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        {%- if waw_active -%}
          <div class="waw-selhead">
            <span class="waw-selchip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="7" cy="8" rx="2.1" ry="2.7"></ellipse><ellipse cx="12" cy="6.4" rx="2.1" ry="2.7"></ellipse><ellipse cx="17" cy="8" rx="2.1" ry="2.7"></ellipse><path d="M12 11c3 0 5.2 2.4 5.2 4.7 0 1.9-1.6 2.9-3.3 2.6-.7-.1-1.3-.3-1.9-.3s-1.2.2-1.9.3c-1.7.3-3.3-.7-3.3-2.6C6.8 13.4 9 11 12 11Z"></path></svg> World Animal Week Offer</span>
            <span class="waw-seldead">Ends October 4</span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="pick-h">{{ section.settings.picker_heading }}</div>

        {%- comment -%}
          Kaching Bundles app block — the real tier radios, the real RoutineCare
          subscription card and the real free-gift rows. Restyled by CSS, never cloned.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="ewof-kaching">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.type == '@app' -%}
              {% render block %}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- if waw_active -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Hand-authored gift panel — Kaching's real free-gift list combines
            these physical items into fewer rows than the three gifts the
            approved design promises, so this panel (real names/images) is
            the truthful source shown to the customer. Toggled by the same
            .ewof-gift-toggle button Kaching's row already renders.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="gifts-panel" data-ewof-waw-gifts hidden>
            <div class="gp-row">
              <div class="gp-thumb"><img src="{{ 'ewof-gift-comb.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="The Tear Stain Comb"></div>
              <div><div class="gp-n">Tear Stain Comb</div><div class="gp-d">Fine teeth lift debris that wipes can't reach deep in the fur.</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="gp-row">
              <div class="gp-thumb"><img src="{{ 'ewof-gift-ebook.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="The Bright Eyes in 30 Days e-book"></div>
              <div><div class="gp-n">Bright Eyes in 30 Days</div><div class="gp-d">Your dog's complete guide to clear eyes and tear stain prevention.</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="gp-row">
              <div class="gp-thumb"><img src="{{ 'ewof-gift-tracker.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="The Bright Eyes Routine Tracker"></div>
              <div><div class="gp-n">Bright Eyes Routine Tracker</div><div class="gp-d">21-day habit tracker to keep your routine consistent.</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} the ONE authoritative add-to-cart pathway {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="ewof-form-host">
          {%- if product != blank -%}
            <product-form
              id="ProductForm-{{ section.id }}"
              class="product-form main-product-form"
              data-section="{{ section.id }}"
              data-main="true"
            >
              <div class="product-form__error-message-wrapper" role="alert" hidden>
                <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-error" viewBox="0 0 13 13" width="13" height="13">
                  <circle cx="6.5" cy="6.5" r="5.5" fill="#EB001B" stroke="#EB001B" stroke-width="0.7"></circle>
                  <path d="M5.87413 3.52832L5.97439 7.57216H7.02713L7.12739 3.52832H5.87413ZM6.50076 9.66091C6.88091 9.66091 7.18169 9.37267 7.18169 9.00504C7.18169 8.63742 6.88091 8.34917 6.50076 8.34917C6.12061 8.34917 5.81982 8.63742 5.81982 9.00504C5.81982 9.37267 6.12061 9.66091 6.50076 9.66091Z" fill="white"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="product-form__error-message"></span>
              </div>

              {%- form 'product',
                product,
                id: product_form_id,
                class: 'form',
                novalidate: 'novalidate',
                data-type: 'add-to-cart-form'
              -%}
                <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}" class="product-variant-id">
                {%- comment -%}
                  Private line-item properties for the cart drawer's bundle image.
                  These ride the MAIN EyeWipes item only. Kaching adds free gifts as
                  separate lines and its `propagate_line_properties` flag is false, so
                  gift lines never inherit them. The JS keeps tier/image in sync.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                <input type="hidden" name="properties[_vp_offer_source]" value="eyewipes-offer-page">
                <input type="hidden" name="properties[_vp_bundle_tier]" id="ewof-prop-tier" value="4-jars">
                <input type="hidden" name="properties[_vp_bundle_image]" id="ewof-prop-image" value="{{ tier1_image }}">
                <button
                  id="ProductSubmitButton-{{ section.id }}"
                  type="submit"
                  name="add"
                  data-ewof-submit
                  class="atc-button product-form__submit main-product-atc cta btn-buy"
                  {% if v.available == false %}disabled{% endif %}
                >
                  <span><span data-ewof-cta-label>{{ tier1_cta }}</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
                </button>
              {%- endform -%}
            </product-form>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if waw_active -%}
          <div class="assure">
            <div class="assure-g">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#13B6B5"></circle><path d="m7.4 12.3 3 3 6.2-6.6" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
              <div>
                <div class="assure-t">Healthy clear eyes OR your money back</div>
                <p class="assure-c">Try EyeWipes for 100 days. If you don't see a cleaner-looking eye area with consistent use, we'll refund you.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="assure-s">
              <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4.5" y="10.5" width="15" height="10.5" rx="2.2" fill="#4F5F6B"></rect><path d="M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2.5" stroke="#4F5F6B" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
              <span>All transactions are secure and encrypted</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="guar-row">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#13B6B5"></circle><path d="m7.4 12.3 3 3 6.2-6.6" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            <span>100-Day Money-Back Guarantee</span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="pay">
          <img class="pay-strip" src="{{ 'ewof-payment-badges.webp' | asset_url }}" width="700" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Accepted payment methods: Mastercard, Visa, PayPal, American Express, Discover and Apple Pay">
        </div>

        {%- unless waw_active -%}
          <div class="secure">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4.5" y="10.5" width="15" height="10.5" rx="2.2" fill="#6B7A85"></rect><path d="M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2.5" stroke="#6B7A85" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
            <span>All transactions are secure and encrypted</span>
          </div>
        {%- endunless -%}

        {%- render 'subscription-disclosure', frequency: section.settings.rc_frequency_label, manage_url: section.settings.manage_subscription_url -%}

        {%- comment -%} information panel {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="info">
          <div class="info-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="About EyeWipes">
            <button type="button" class="info-tab on" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Vet Reviewed</button>
            <button type="button" class="info-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Ingredients</button>
            <button type="button" class="info-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">How To Use</button>
            <button type="button" class="info-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Benefits</button>
          </div>
          <div class="info-body">
            <div class="info-panel" role="tabpanel">
              <div class="vet">
                <div class="vet-eyebrow">
                  <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6 4.8 5.4v6.1c0 4.5 3 8.6 7.2 9.9 4.2-1.3 7.2-5.4 7.2-9.9V5.4L12 2.6Z" fill="#1F7FB8"></path><path d="m8.6 12.2 2.6 2.6 4.4-4.7" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
                  Veterinarian Reviewed
                </div>
                <h3 class="vet-h">A Practical Approach to Daily Eye Care</h3>
                <div class="vet-grid">
                  <p class="vet-p">EyeWipes gives pet owners a simple, controlled way to remove the buildup that collects around the eyes each day. The textured pads help lift residue from the fur and skin without rinsing or complicated grooming, making the routine easy to repeat consistently.</p>
